{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53905","headline":"答裴相国休 · 希运","name":"答裴相国休","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"心如大海无边际，口吐红莲养病身。\n虽有一双无事手，不曾只揖等闲人。\n（《黄蘖断际禅师宛陵录》、《天圣广灯录》卷八。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"希运","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53905.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53905","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}